hexagonrpcd: serve /sys/project_info

OnePlus's SLPI firmware (OnePlus 7T Pro) reads
/sys/project_info/project_name, as its sns_reg_config says, and picks
per-project behaviour in its sensor drivers (the TCS3701 and STK2232
drivers log the project). Serve <root>/project_info/ there, or an empty
directory when it is missing, as /sys/devices/soc0 is served.

